  "brief": {
    "zh": "取齐南北两枚纪念章和东门的回程票，到西侧横桥旁的小票亭交票。东门的踏板会升起西门、东门两侧的横桥栅栏。栅栏打开后保持开启，广场中段仍有巡车和周期脉冲。限 64 回合。",
    "en": "Collect the north and south souvenir stamps and the return ticket at the east pedal. Check in at the little booth beside the western crossbridge. The east pedal lifts both fences on the crossbridge. The fences stay up, but a patrol and a periodic pulse still cross the middle of the fair. You have 64 turns."
